#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.0.0"
msgstr "v1.0.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.0.0 is the first public release of OpenMV IDE, a customized Qt Creator "
"build (Qt Creator 4.0.2) tailored for developing on the OpenMV Cam. It adds "
"USB serial discovery and connection, on-cam script execution, a live frame "
"buffer and histogram, and Python traceback navigation. There are no breaking"
" changes, as this is the initial release."
msgstr ""
"v1.0.0 是 OpenMV IDE 的首个公开发布版本，它是为在 OpenMV Cam 上开发而定制的 Qt Creator 构建版本（Qt "
"Creator 4.0.2）。它增加了 USB 串口发现与连接、摄像头上脚本执行、实时帧缓冲区和直方图，以及 Python "
"回溯信息导航。由于这是初始发布版本，因此没有破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"**OpenMV-branded Qt Creator** with its own splash screen, an ``Examples`` "
"menu, and a Python editor that opens new untitled ``.py`` files pre-filled "
"with a sensor snapshot template for the OpenMV Cam."
msgstr ""
"**带 OpenMV 品牌标识的 Qt Creator**\\ ，拥有自己的启动画面、一个 ``Examples`` 菜单，以及一个 Python "
"编辑器，它会打开新的无标题 ``.py`` 文件，并预先填入适用于 OpenMV Cam 的传感器快照模板。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Connect** enumerates serial ports matching the OpenMV Cam VID/PID and "
"reads back the board firmware version, shown in the status bar."
msgstr "**连接（Connect）** 会枚举与 OpenMV Cam VID/PID 匹配的串口，并读回板载固件版本，显示在状态栏中。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Run on cam** with ``Connect``/``Disconnect``/``Start``/``Stop`` toolbar "
"controls: ``Start`` (``Ctrl+R``) sends the current script to the cam and "
"``Stop`` halts it."
msgstr ""
"**在摄像头上运行（Run on cam）**\\ ，配有 ``Connect``/``Disconnect``/``Start``/``Stop`` "
"工具栏控件：\\ ``Start``\\ （\\ ``Ctrl+R``\\ ）将当前脚本发送到摄像头，\\ ``Stop`` 则停止它。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Live Frame Buffer** viewer with zoom-to-fit, optional JPEG compression, a "
"disable toggle for maximum performance, and a live FPS readout."
msgstr ""
"**实时帧缓冲区（Live Frame Buffer）** 查看器，支持缩放以适应窗口、可选的 JPEG 压缩、用于获得最高性能的禁用开关，以及实时 "
"FPS 读数。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Live Histogram** panel switchable between RGB, Grayscale, LAB, and YUV "
"color spaces (Grayscale/LAB recommended for color tracking)."
msgstr ""
"**实时直方图（Live Histogram）** 面板，可在 RGB、灰度、LAB 和 YUV 颜色空间之间切换（推荐使用灰度/LAB "
"进行颜色跟踪）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Traceback navigation** parses Python errors from the cam and jumps the "
"editor to the offending file and line."
msgstr "**回溯信息导航（Traceback navigation）** 会解析来自摄像头的 Python 错误，并将编辑器跳转到出错的文件和行。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:36
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新特性"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"**OpenMV IDE shell.** The application launches with the ``OpenMV IDE`` "
"display name and an OpenMV splash screen, adds an ``Examples`` submenu built"
" by scanning the bundled examples directory, and overrides the ``New`` "
"action so untitled ``.py`` files open pre-filled with an ``import sensor`` "
"snapshot template and generic Python highlighting."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV IDE 外壳。** 应用程序以 ``OpenMV IDE`` 显示名称和 OpenMV 启动画面启动，通过扫描捆绑的示例目录构建出一个"
" ``Examples`` 子菜单，并重写了 ``New`` 操作，使无标题 ``.py`` 文件打开时预先填入 ``import sensor`` "
"快照模板并采用通用 Python 语法高亮。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Connect / firmware version.** ``Connect`` enumerates available serial "
"ports filtering on the OpenMV Cam USB VID/PID (``0x1209``/``0xABD1``), "
"prompts a port-selection dialog when more than one matches, opens the port, "
"reads the board firmware version, and displays it in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"**连接 / 固件版本。** ``Connect`` 会枚举可用串口，并按 OpenMV Cam USB VID/PID（\\ "
"``0x1209``/``0xABD1``\\ ）进行过滤，当匹配到多个端口时弹出端口选择对话框，打开端口，读取板载固件版本，并将其显示在状态栏中。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Script execution controls.** ``Connect``, ``Disconnect``, ``Start``, and "
"``Stop`` actions drive the camera. ``Start`` (``Ctrl+R``) sends the current "
"editor's script to the cam for execution, ``Stop`` halts the running script,"
" and the IDE tracks running state to enable or disable the ``Stop`` button."
msgstr ""
"**脚本执行控件。** ``Connect``\\ 、\\ ``Disconnect``\\ 、\\ ``Start`` 和 ``Stop`` "
"操作用于驱动摄像头。\\ ``Start``\\ （\\ ``Ctrl+R``\\ ）将当前编辑器的脚本发送到摄像头执行，\\ ``Stop`` "
"停止正在运行的脚本，IDE 会跟踪运行状态以启用或禁用 ``Stop`` 按钮。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Frame Buffer viewer.** A ``Frame Buffer`` panel renders frames streamed "
"from the cam, with zoom-to-fit, an optional JPEG-compression toggle for "
"higher framerate, a disable toggle for maximum performance, and a live FPS "
"label."
msgstr ""
"**帧缓冲区查看器。** ``Frame Buffer`` 面板会渲染从摄像头流式传输过来的帧，支持缩放以适应窗口、用于提高帧率的可选 JPEG "
"压缩开关、用于获得最高性能的禁用开关，以及实时 FPS 标签。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Save image and templates.** Right-click context actions on the Frame "
"Buffer save an image to disk (BMP/JPG/PNG/PPM), save a template image "
"(BMP/JPG/PGM/PPM), or save a keypoint/feature descriptor (``.lbp``/``.ff``) "
"directly onto the cam's drive. When a rubber-band region is dragged over the"
" frame, all three actions operate on the cropped selection and their menu "
"labels change accordingly (for example ``Save Image selection to PC``); "
"otherwise they use the full displayed frame."
msgstr ""
"**保存图像和模板。** "
"帧缓冲区上的右键上下文操作可将图像保存到磁盘（BMP/JPG/PNG/PPM）、保存模板图像（BMP/JPG/PGM/PPM），或将关键点/特征描述符（\\"
" ``.lbp``/``.ff``\\ "
"）直接保存到摄像头的驱动器上。当在帧上拖动出一个橡皮筋选区时，这三个操作都会作用于裁剪后的选区，其菜单标签也会相应改变（例如 ``Save Image "
"selection to PC``\\ ）；否则它们使用完整显示的帧。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Histogram panel.** A ``Histogram`` panel plots the current frame's channel"
" distribution and can be switched between RGB, Grayscale, LAB, and YUV color"
" spaces."
msgstr "**直方图面板。** ``Histogram`` 面板会绘制当前帧的通道分布，并可在 RGB、灰度、LAB 和 YUV 颜色空间之间切换。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Traceback navigation.** Python tracebacks printed by the cam are parsed "
"live; the IDE opens or focuses the offending file (resolving files on the "
"cam's drive when needed), jumps to the reported line, and pops the error "
"message. Serial output is also forwarded to the ``Message Manager`` "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"**回溯信息导航。** 摄像头打印的 Python 回溯信息会被实时解析；IDE "
"会打开或聚焦到出错的文件（必要时解析摄像头驱动器上的文件），跳转到报告的行，并弹出错误消息。串口输出也会被转发到 ``Message Manager``"
" 终端。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Cam drive association.** The IDE associates a removable FAT/msdos drive "
"with the connected cam via the ``Drive:`` status-bar button, enabling on-cam"
" file save targets and traceback file resolution."
msgstr ""
"**摄像头驱动器关联。** IDE 通过 ``Drive:`` 状态栏按钮将一个可移动的 FAT/msdos "
"驱动器与已连接的摄像头关联起来，从而启用摄像头上的文件保存目标和回溯文件解析。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Help menu and persisted state.** The ``Help`` menu adds OpenMV Docs, "
"Forums, an About OpenMV Cam pinout link, and an About OpenMV IDE dialog. "
"Window state, including splitter positions, zoom, JPG compression, the "
"disable-frame-buffer toggle, the histogram color space, and the last serial "
"port, persists across sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Help 菜单与持久化状态。** ``Help`` 菜单新增了 OpenMV Docs、Forums、一个 About OpenMV Cam "
"引脚图链接，以及一个 About OpenMV IDE 对话框。窗口状态（包括分隔条位置、缩放、JPG "
"压缩、禁用帧缓冲区开关、直方图颜色空间，以及上次使用的串口）会在多个会话之间持久保存。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:79
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:81
msgid ""
"On Linux, a permission-denied connect failure prompts the ``sudo usermod -a "
"-G dialout`` dialout-group fix."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，连接时出现权限被拒绝（permission-denied）的失败会提示使用 ``sudo usermod -a -G "
"dialout`` 进行 dialout 组修复的对话框。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:85
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台与工具支持"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:87
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基础版本：** 4.0.2。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:88
msgid ""
"The plugin communicates with the cam over a custom USB-debug serial "
"protocol. Several protocol-level capabilities are present in the IO layer "
"but are not surfaced in the UI in this release: a flash bootloader (start, "
"reset, erase, write), camera-attribute controls (contrast, brightness, "
"saturation, gain ceiling), a system-reset command, and a frame-update path. "
"None of these are wired to a menu, button, or widget for users yet."
msgstr ""
"该插件通过自定义 USB 调试串口协议与摄像头通信。IO 层中存在若干协议级能力，但在本版本的 UI "
"中尚未呈现出来：闪存引导加载程序（启动、复位、擦除、写入）、摄像头属性控件（对比度、亮度、饱和度、增益上限）、系统复位命令，以及帧更新通道。这些功能目前都尚未连接到任何菜单、按钮或控件供用户使用。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:96
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破坏性变更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.0.0.rst:98
msgid "None. This is the initial release of OpenMV IDE."
msgstr "无。这是 OpenMV IDE 的初始发布版本。"
